From 8f1b4f598ea6c985d073d9b4cad39f8f75f57968 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:18:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 13: selection mode with share, favorites and trash

- Long-press selects; tap toggles; Select all; top count bar + bottom action bar (tab bar hidden)
- Share multiple items, favorite/unfavorite and move to trash via MediaStore write requests
  (system confirmation dialogs, split in batches of 500)
- Favorite and delete buttons in the viewer; leaves the viewer when the last item is trashed
- Favorite heart shown on thumbnails; selected thumbnails shrink with a check indicator
- Back closes selection mode; MediaSelectionController shared by Pictures, Album and Viewer
